<title>USA: Conn. House Speaker Ritter seeks second term.</title>
<headline>Conn. House Speaker Ritter seeks second term.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Connecticut State House Speaker Thomas Ritter is running for another term in a vote the Democrats hold on Friday.</p>
<p>Ritter faces a challenge from William Dyson, who currently heads up the powerful appropriations committee.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
